// Phase 6 workspace mode - iframes load relative paths like ../source/main/…
// but browsers DROP the parent document's query string when resolving relative
// URLs. That means the iframe's own URL has no `?project=…`, and every asset
// it loads (Referer = the iframe's URL) also has no project context. The
// daemon then falls back to the alphabetically-first project - wrong project's
// files load silently. Fix: rewrite the iframe path to an absolute URL with
// `?project=<id>` baked in, so the iframe document URL carries the project
// and Referer-based resolution works for nested loads too.
